# ascii

- _ascii(s)_

Answers a `List` of the Ascii encoding of the string _s_,
which must be an Ascii string.

The Ascii encoding of 'ascii':

```
>>> 'ascii'.ascii
[97 115 99 105 105]
```

* * *

See also: List, String, asciiByteArray, asciiString

Guides: String Functions

